{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Ebuc walks in leaving a note for Daysong written in Gnomish\n\n|| .\nMy time was short, quick, and fun.\nThe lives of all, absolve to one.\nOne chance we have, to end a blight.\nDo not grieve, if I die tonight\n\nA fez you wear, a proud head piece.\nOne that most, would just release.\nMy brothers and sisters, Masons of all.\nTonight I fight, and I'll stand tall\n\nI do not fear, the possible chance.\nOf playing with death, and losing the dance.\nI battle in hope, of a brighter day.\nOne that most, attempted to sway.\n\nFor this may be, my final say.\nAlas, fear not, enjoy the day.\nI fight for you, Master Daysong.\nI hope you know, I meant no wrong.\n\nA mason devout, I wish to be.\nKeep your lanterns lit, and pray for me.\nDo not weep, do not cry.\nFarewell, my friends, no... Family....goodbye.\n\n. ||","created_at":"2020-07-31T02:12:35.182000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738579836544614430","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
