{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"“He has given me much to think about, but I am still unsure of what decision I should make. My friends are about to risk there lives for the chance everyone will have a better future, and they’ve asked me to join them. Each of them is standing proud in there decision to go, however I am hesitant. In all honesty; I’m scared. However if they were to go without me, and perish, i don’t think that would be something I’d be able to live with.”","created_at":"2020-07-31T02:30:23.757000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738584318473142422","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"I hold no hope who for any who enter. It would be a reckless loss for any Mason to go. But you above the others have felt my call to leadership. Did you not set your intentions to help govern the colony? Do nothing rash, but with understanding move forward.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T02:32:35.485000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-31T02:32:45.427000Z","id":"738584870980419614","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
